.TH ADVANCED-IP-ANALYSER 1 "August 2026" "Advanced IP Analyser 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
advanced-ip-analyser \- discover and inventory authorized network hosts
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B advanced-ip-analyser
.I scan TARGET
[
.B --timeout SECONDS
]
[
.B --workers COUNT
]
[
.B --output FILE
]
.br
.B advanced-ip-analyser wake MAC
[
.B --broadcast ADDRESS
]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Advanced IP Analyser scans an IPv4 or IPv6 address, CIDR, or inclusive range,
identifies reachable devices and common TCP services, and exports inventories.
Use it only on networks and systems you own or are authorized to administer.
.SH GUI
Run
.B advanced-ip-analyser-gui
for the Debian desktop interface, saved devices, service launchers,
Wake-on-LAN, SSH power actions, and automatic updates.
.SH FILES
.I ~/.config/advanced-ip-analyser/favorites.json
stores the current user's saved devices.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ping (8),
.BR tracepath (8),
.BR ssh (1)
